# Google Drive / Docs: service-specific hosts and desktop client processes.
# Reference: https://support.google.com/a/answer/2589954
# Shared Google login, API and image hosts keep their existing routing.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,drive.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,drive.usercontent.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,drive-data-export.usercontent.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,drive-data-export-eu.usercontent.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googledrive.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,docs.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,drive.googleusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,docs.googleusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sheets.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,slides.google.com
DOMAIN,drive.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-REGEX,^doc-[a-z0-9-]+-(drive|docs|apps-viewer)\.googleusercontent\.com$
PROCESS-NAME,GoogleDriveFS.exe
PROCESS-NAME,GoogleDriveFS
